From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 17:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] data: Start along with Phosh

The keyboard waited until Phosh was ready, while Phosh already asks for
the keyring password during its own start. A tap into that field found
no input method for several seconds. Only the display and the session
are needed, so use the ordering of Phosh itself. The unit gets pulled in
by a drop-in of mobi.phosh.Shell.service (plinius-osk-early.conf).
---
 data/mobi.phosh.Stevia.service.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/data/mobi.phosh.Stevia.service.in b/data/mobi.phosh.Stevia.service.in
index f8ecf75..ada5bd2 100644
--- a/data/mobi.phosh.Stevia.service.in
+++ b/data/mobi.phosh.Stevia.service.in
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@ Description=Stevia, a user friendly on screen keyboard
 Documentation=https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/stevia
 CollectMode=inactive-or-failed
 
-After=gnome-session-initialized.target
+After=gnome-session-manager.target
 PartOf=mobi.phosh.OSK.target
 
 [Service]
